              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sipupu sie basuubili siaba alala mu mebaasio ne mu mwoyo. Se abao na mulala owaloma ali sisiewe aba sisiewe yeng'ene tawe, ne kakhali buli mundu akabananga ne babaasie buli nisio aba nasio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bunyali bukali barumwa baana buloli khu lilamukha lio Mwami Yesu, ne Wele abaelesia kumwalaalo kumukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se abao na mulala khu nibo owataamba sisiindu tawe. Abo ba baaba ne kimikuunda namwe chinju bakusia, ne bayila chirupia nicho bakusiisiemo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bachiaana khu barumwa, mala chirupia chikabwa khu buli mulala khuloondekhana ne butinyu bwewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Yosefu, Omulawi niye barumwa batiuukha bali Baranaba owasaalwa abuundu bali Saipurasi (liboola lili, “Omwana we lichuuba”) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akusia kumukuunda nikwo aba nakwo, mala areera chirupia khu barumwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
